<Project>
  <!--
    12.3.3 buildfix 3:
    Keep the standard SDK intermediate layout (obj\...).
    Do NOT override BaseIntermediateOutputPath here.

    Buildfix 2 changed BaseIntermediateOutputPath to a nested folder under obj.
    That caused the SDK wildcard Compile items to see generated AssemblyInfo.cs
    files from the old obj layout and the new layout at the same time, producing
    CS0579 duplicate assembly attributes.

    This intentionally-empty props file also overwrites the broken buildfix 2
    file when the archive is extracted over an existing working tree.
  -->
</Project>
